      "judgment_rationale": "ProjectChannelsRedirect sends the canonical Web project Channels route to PluginHub with project context. That production page owns tenant plugin discovery and lifecycle, plugin configuration, the channel catalog and schema, and project channel-config CRUD and test; it does not call the single-config read, status, or observability APIs, and PluginDetail remains a separate route boundary. Cloud Desktop's native ChannelConnectionsDialog implements only catalog, schema, and channel-config CRUD and test, behind the SettingsWindow admin-or-owner UI gate intersected with tenant and project service authority. Local parity routes deliberately report channel runtime as not applicable."
